    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3c <strong>One Brick at a Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/5208a2e9bb32944980f3348944be5ea1.poster.avif?t=1751304138\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/5208a2e9bb32944980f3348944be5ea1.webm?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/5208a2e9bb32944980f3348944be5ea1.mp4?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No timers. No pressure. Just the quiet joy of placing bricks and watching something take shape. Build alone or together on a shared screen. Maybe a tiny cottage, maybe a wobbly tower, maybe something only you understand. That\u2019s the fun of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Every Shape Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.poster.avif?t=1751304138\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.webm?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.mp4?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pick from curated sets of bricks (from ramps and slates, to tiny details) and mix them however you like! Each palette is like opening a new box of building toys. Mix and match pieces, follow a feeling, or just stack whatever makes you smile. There\u2019s no wrong way to build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Make It Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.poster.avif?t=1751304138\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.webm?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.mp4?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pick from a cozy palette filled with warm reds, deep greens, soft creams, and sunny yellows. Maybe your build wants a cheerful roof, a quiet brick wall, or a splash of something unexpected. Try things out, follow your mood, and see where the colors take you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ohh, and did I mention it? You can\u00a0share your builds as step-by-step blueprints for others to enjoy! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you build? Unwind, create, and find joy. One brick at a time. \ud83e\udde1</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3c <strong>One Brick at a Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/5208a2e9bb32944980f3348944be5ea1.poster.avif?t=1751304138\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/5208a2e9bb32944980f3348944be5ea1.webm?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/5208a2e9bb32944980f3348944be5ea1.mp4?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No timers. No pressure. Just the quiet joy of placing bricks and watching something take shape. Build alone or together on a shared screen. Maybe a tiny cottage, maybe a wobbly tower, maybe something only you understand. That\u2019s the fun of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Every Shape Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.poster.avif?t=1751304138\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.webm?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.mp4?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pick from curated sets of bricks (from ramps and slates, to tiny details) and mix them however you like! Each palette is like opening a new box of building toys. Mix and match pieces, follow a feeling, or just stack whatever makes you smile. There\u2019s no wrong way to build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Make It Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.poster.avif?t=1751304138\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.webm?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.mp4?t=1751304138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pick from a cozy palette filled with warm reds, deep greens, soft creams, and sunny yellows. Maybe your build wants a cheerful roof, a quiet brick wall, or a splash of something unexpected. Try things out, follow your mood, and see where the colors take you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ohh, and did I mention it? You can\u00a0share your builds as step-by-step blueprints for others to enjoy! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you build? Unwind, create, and find joy. One brick at a time. \ud83e\udde1</p>",
